  "notes": "Juniata County Republicans elected '<precinct> REPUBLICAN COMMITTEEPERSON' in all 18 precincts at the 2026 primary, with 1 to 6 seats per precinct (45 total), so seats_per_precinct is null and seats are labelled Committeeperson 1..N. Republican committee contests were not on the 2024 or 2025 primary ballots. The official report names individual write-in recipients. Seats are filled in order of votes: a ballot candidate with votes = filled; a place held by a named write-in = unknown (named write-in winners stay unknown because acceptance isn't public); a tie across the cutoff = unknown (common, since many write-ins got 1 vote); leftover seats = unknown if write-in votes were cast, empty if none. Appointments since the primary are not captured."
